    "authority_boundary": "Experiment metadata and finite computation are evidence, not proof authority; claim status changes only through Lean, an exact counterexample, or the named owner verifier.",
    "hypothesis": {
      "id": "cone_bound_via_monotone_harmonic_functional",
      "statement": "On the model g(zeta) = zeta^n + n zeta the inequality (star) is the statement that Im Xi, with Xi(zeta) = (n-2) zeta - zeta^{2-n}, is monotone along a descending branch away from its hub value c_n; the monotonicity follows from sector confinement alone, at every degree and on both branches."
    },
    "links": {
      "analysis_refs": [
        "formal_math/erdos257_period_noncollapse/ErdosProblems/Erdos1041/ConeBoundMonotoneFunctional.md"
      ],
